#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:492
msgid ""
"Direct manipulation of <application>Gnumeric</application> files is possible"
" by transforming the files to text files and then using standard text file "
"tools like document editors. In order to read the contents a "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> file must first be decompressed and can "
"then be opened. In GNU systems, the <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"default file \"Book1.gnumeric\" can be uncompressed as follows: "
"<_:screen-1/> alternatively, the file can be renamed and then uncompressed "
"with the following pair of commands: <_:screen-2/> both possibilities yield "
"the file \"Book1.text\" which is an ASCII text file. This file can be opened"
" in any editor, like <application>Vim</application> or "
"<application>Emacs</application>, or pager, like "
"<application>Less</application>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan hantera <application>Gnumeric</application>-filer direkt genom att "
"omvandla dem till textfiler och sedan använda vanliga textverktyg, till "
"exempel textredigerare. Om du vill läsa innehållet måste du först packa upp "
"en <application>Gnumeric</application>-fil. På GNU-system kan standardfilen "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ”Book1.gnumeric” packas upp så här: "
"<_:screen-1/> Du kan också byta namn på filen och sedan packa upp den med "
"följande kommandon: <_:screen-2/> Båda metoderna ger filen ”Book1.text”, en "
"ASCII-textfil. Den kan öppnas i valfri redigerare, till exempel "
"<application>Vim</application> eller <application>Emacs</application>, eller"
" i en textvisare som <application>Less</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:520
msgid ""
"XML manipulation tools can be used to transform "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> files and access the data they contain, "
"since the file format is XML. The file can be validated by an XML Schema "
"Definition (XSD) . These are available via the Internet at "
"<uri>http://git.gnome.org/cgit/gnumeric/plain/gnumeric.xsd</uri>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda XML-verktyg för att omvandla "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-filer och komma åt deras data eftersom "
"filformatet bygger på XML. Validera filen med en XML Schema Definition "
"(XSD). Schemat finns på "
"<uri>http://git.gnome.org/cgit/gnumeric/plain/gnumeric.xsd</uri>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:528
msgid ""
"The Java<trademark/> Language can be used to create, access, or manipulate "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> format files using the "
"<application>JWorkbook</application> project library. See the project's "
"<ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://http://www.jfree.org/jworkbook/index.html\"> website</ulink> "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda Java<trademark/>-språket för att skapa, läsa och ändra filer "
"i <application>Gnumeric</application>-format med projektbiblioteket "
"<application>JWorkbook</application>. Mer information finns på projektets "
"<ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://http://www.jfree.org/jworkbook/index.html\">webbplats</ulink>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:537
msgid ""
"The C# language, through the <application>mono</application> implementation "
"can also be used to manipulate <application>Gnumeric</application> format "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även hantera <application>Gnumeric</application>-filer med C# via "
"implementationen <application>mono</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:567
msgid "Applix File Format"
msgstr "Formatet Applix"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:569
msgid ""
"The Applix file format is used by the <application>Applixware</application> "
"group of applications which include a spreadsheet component. The "
"<application>Applixware</application> spreadsheet is made by <ulink "
"type=\"http\" url=\"http://www.vistasource.com\">Vistasource</ulink> and "
"claims to be a 'real-time', event driven software system."
msgstr ""
"Filformatet Applix används av programsviten "
"<application>Applixware</application>, som innehåller ett kalkylprogram. "
"Kalkylprogrammet <application>Applixware</application> utvecklas av <ulink "
"type=\"http\" url=\"http://www.vistasource.com\">Vistasource</ulink> och "
"beskrivs som ett realtidsbaserat, händelsestyrt system."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:579
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can read some files produced by the "
"<application>Applixware</application> spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan läsa vissa filer som skapats med "
"kalkylprogrammet <application>Applixware</application>."

